{"id":79,"date":"2018-03-29T16:33:17","date_gmt":"2018-03-29T16:33:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/technobabble.guru\/montclairhoa\/?page_id=79"},"modified":"2026-06-11T22:14:14","modified_gmt":"2026-06-12T02:14:14","slug":"pool","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/pool\/","title":{"rendered":"Pool"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph\">The Montclair pool is a 25-yard, L-shaped pool complete with two diving boards.&nbsp; The secured, fenced area is surrounded on three sides by trees that provide privacy with ample space for catching rays, picnicking or just relaxing by the pool.&nbsp; Montclair Pool is &#8220;Swim At Your Own Risk&#8221; which allows the pool to be available from May until early October (weather permitting). Lifeguards are on duty during peak times starting Memorial Day and before school starts back in August.&nbsp; <strong>Pool Memberships are available to Montclair Residents and Non-Residents. <\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>All pool access is monitored via security system. All key code entry and guest fees are enforced.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Pool Opens: <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">May 1st, 2026<\/span><\/strong> (Swim at Your Own Risk, No Lifeguard on duty)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Pool Hours:<\/strong><br>Monday &#8211; Friday (7:00am &#8211; 9:00pm)<br>Saturday&#8217;s (7:00am &#8211; 8:00pm)<br>Sunday&#8217;s (1:00pm &#8211; 9:00pm)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">REQUIRED:<\/span> 2026 Pool Members must come up to the pool to complete the required liability paperwork and get their code at the pool.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Montclair Pool In-Person Registration Dates:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">April 5th<strong> (2:00pm-5:00pm) <\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">April 11th<strong> (2:00pm-5:00pm)<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">April 18th <strong>(2:00pm-5:00pm)<\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400\">April 25th <strong>(2:00pm-5:00pm)<\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>All other dates for in-person registration will be at the Pool Concession Stand or announced via email.<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-4 wp-block-paragraph\">.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Email Questions to <a href=\"mailto:montclairpoolaug@gmail.com\">montclairpoolaug@gmail.com<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong>2026 Pool Season Flyer<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1212\" height=\"1296\" src=\"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Montclair-pool-opening-event-flyer.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1611\" style=\"width:606px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Montclair-pool-opening-event-flyer.png 1212w, https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Montclair-pool-opening-event-flyer-281x300.png 281w, https:\/\/montclairhoa.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Montclair-pool-opening-event-flyer-958x1024.png 958w, https:\/\/mon